    "updated_at": "2023-01-09T17:51:20Z",
    "body": "I think we might be okay. The specific problem that might be UB with shared memory as I understood it from @hsivonen is if you have JS and C++ accessing the shared memory at the same time, JS manipulating it, and C++ using it for something. However, all we have is \"write into buffer\" and \"copy from buffer\". So I think we're okay.",
